SpecialFanoFourfolds -- A package for working with Hodge-special fourfolds
**************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package contains several tools related to the rationality problem for
cubic fourfolds, Gushel-Mukai fourfolds, and some other special Fano fourfolds.
See arXiv:2204.11518 (see https://arxiv.org/abs/2204.11518 ) for some
applications.

Version History
===============

  * v. 1.0 (Oct 2019) - Initial version.
  * v. 2.7.1 (May 2023) - Consolidated stable version.
  * v. 2.8 (Apr 2026) - Updates and new features.

The following papers have made use of this package.

