    P^7, available at arXiv:2312.01773 (see https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.01773 )
    (2023).
  * M. Hoff and G. Staglianò, Explicit constructions of K3 surfaces and
    unirational Noether-Lefschetz divisors, available at arXiv:2110.15819 (see
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.15819 ) (2021).
  * G. Staglianò, Some new rational Gushel fourfolds, available at
    arXiv:2003.07809 (see https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.07809 ) (2020).
  * G. Staglianò, On some families of Gushel-Mukai fourfolds, available at
    arXiv:2002.07026 (see https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.07026 ) (2020).
  * M. Hoff and G. Staglianò, New examples of rational Gushel-Mukai fourfolds,
    available at arXiv:1910.12838 (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.12838 )
