    (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.01263 ) (2020).
  * F. Russo and G. Staglianò, Explicit rationality of some cubic fourfolds,
    available at arXiv:1811.03502 (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.03502 )
    (2019).
  * F. Russo and G. Staglianò, Congruences of 5-secant conics and the
