detectCongruence(CubicFourfold,ZZ) -- detect and return a congruence of (3e-1)-secant curves of degree e
********************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note detectCongruence: detectCongruence,
  * Usage: 
        detectCongruence X
        detectCongruence(X,e)
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note cubic fourfold: CubicFourfold,, containing a surface
        $S\subset\mathbb{P}^5$
      * e, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, a positive integer (optional
        but recommended)
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Verbose: Verbose, => ..., default value false, request verbose
        feedback
  * Outputs:
