discriminant(CubicFourfold) -- discriminant of a special cubic fourfold
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note discriminant:
    (Elimination)discriminant_lpRingElement_cmRingElement_rp,
  * Usage: 
        discriminant X
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note cubic fourfold: CubicFourfold,
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Algorithm: (Resultants)resultant_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmAlgorithm=>_pd_pd_
        pd_rp, => ..., default value null,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the discriminant of $X$

Description
===========

This calculation passes through the determination of the topological Euler
characteristic of the surface contained in the fourfold, which is obtained
thanks to the functions *note EulerCharacteristic:
(Cremona)EulerCharacteristic, and *note Euler: (CharacteristicClasses)Euler,
(the option Algorithm allows you to select the method).

