HodgeSpecialFourfold -- the class of all Hodge-special fourfolds
****************************************************************

Description
===========

An object of the class *note HodgeSpecialFourfold: HodgeSpecialFourfold, is
basically represented by a pair (S,X), where $X$ is a fourfold and $S$ is a
surface contained in $X$. Such objects are created by the function *note
specialFourfold: specialFourfold,.

