Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = PP_(ZZ/65521)[2,2];                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : ProjectiveVariety, surface in PP^5                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Y = ambient S;                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : ProjectiveVariety, PP^5                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
