|                                                                             |
|o2 : ProjectiveVariety, 4-dimensional subvariety of PP^9                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ? X                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 4-dimensional subvariety of PP^9 cut out by 7 hypersurfaces of degrees  |
|     1^2 2^5                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
