| -- used 0.827592s (cpu); 0.650984s (thread); 0s (gc)                        |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = multi-rational map consisting of one single rational map                |
|     source variety: PP^4                                                    |
|     target variety: 4-dimensional subvariety of PP^9 cut out by 7           |
|     dominance: true                                                         |
|     degree: 1                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : MultirationalMap (birational map from PP^4 to X)                        |
