toExternalString(HodgeSpecialFourfold) -- convert to a readable string
**********************************************************************

  * Function: *note toExternalString: (Macaulay2Doc)toExternalString,
  * Usage: 
        toExternalString X
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note Hodge-special fourfold: HodgeSpecialFourfold,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, a string representation of X,
        which can be used, in conjunction with *note value:
        (Macaulay2Doc)value,, to read the object back into the program later

Description
===========

Some of the internal data of the input X are included in the returned string.

+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : describe (X = specialFourfold "tau-quadric")          |
|                                                           |
|o1 = Special Gushel-Mukai fourfold of discriminant 10(')   |
|     containing a surface of degree 2 and sectional genus 0|
